comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-03T08:27:22.410Z","harness:codex","text=Duplicate check evidence: searched all 2,292 items across every status for GH-878, workspace snapshot help, unknown_command, help availability, and contracts closure. Closed pm-6j7r1a owns enumerated-versus-resolvable root spellings and closed pm-1jrdri owns rendered-versus-contracted roots; GH-878 is the distinct nested action-path and help self-resolution regression. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/878"
  "2026-08-03T08:38:45.431Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: structured JSON help now resolves contract-backed positional paths through their nearest registered Commander parent while retaining the requested canonical path; implicit help self-resolution is admitted from the core command contract. The integration gate invokes structured help for every command emitted by contracts and verifies the exact requested tokens. Focused suite passed 2/2 tests, including all 116 current command paths; both 'help --json workspace snapshot create' and 'help --json help' return exit 0 with exact resolved_path values."
  "2026-08-03T08:46:17.117Z","harness:codex","Coverage hardening: the first repo-wide run passed all 6,759 tests but correctly failed the 100% threshold because the new path resolver branches were not directly instrumented. Added focused source-level tests for empty/exact/implicit/positional/orphaned/unknown paths and direct/lifecycle/invalid flag-contract membership; focused verification now passes 5/5 across the unit invariant and all-command integration gate. No ignore pragma or threshold exception was added."
